                userName
                password

            UserLoginResponseDTO
                userName
                firstName
                lastName
                email
                age
                gender

            we don't use User directly. User is directly linked to the database.
            we do direct operations with User obj. we should not move this entity over internet/ won't expose over internet.
            instead we expose DTOs.
            DTO -> copy it to entity -> save it to db
            again form a DTO -- send back to --> client

            (also for huge data, the response will gets slowdown if entities are used)

            An object talking to client, should not interact with the database. An object interacting with the database should not interact with the client.

